# Without the route, the write hands back an id and nothing will say anything
# about it: the caller stores a handle to nothing.

title: a posted transaction id has no endpoint that resolves it
file: internal/ledgerhttp/ledgerhttp.go
run: go test -count=1 -run TestAPostedTransactionIsServedBackUnderTheIdItWasGiven -v ./internal/ledgerhttp/
--- before
	mux.HandleFunc("GET /v1/transactions/{id}", s.transaction)
--- after
	// negative control: the id the write returns is a handle to nothing
